border-border-300 text-danger-000 whitespace-pre-wrap rounded-[0.4rem] px-1=
 py-px text-[0.9rem]">isbn</code> number! However, a library usually doesn=
=E2=80=99t have just one copy of a book: it usually has multiple copies of =
